pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 36, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: PROMPTING
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 60, 760, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 提示词示例：把想法说清楚
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 112, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: bad-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 134, 400, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "#E05C5C"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: ✕ 坏提示词
  - elementId: bad-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 164, 400, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#E05C5C"}
  - elementId: bad-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 178, 352, 92]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>"帮我做一个打地鼠游戏。"</p>
        <p><span style="color:$muted; font-size:13px">—— 没有规则、没有界面要求，AI 只能瞎猜</span></p>
  - elementId: good-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [496, 134, 400, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "#6CBF6C"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: ✓ 好提示词
  - elementId: good-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [496, 164, 400, 216]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$panel"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#6CBF6C"}
  - elementId: good-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 178, 352, 192]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.2
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>"用 HTML + JavaScript 做一个打地鼠网页游戏：</p>
        <p>· 3×3 格子，地鼠每 1 秒随机出现；</p>
        <p>· 点中加 1 分，30 秒倒计时；</p>
        <p>· 结束后显示总分和'再玩一次'按钮；</p>
        <p>· 深色背景、大按钮，适合初中生。"</p>
  - elementId: formula-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 380, 832, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: formula-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 396, 832, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$accent"
      bold: true
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 好提示词公式
  - elementId: formula-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 428, 832, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: 微软雅黑
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>目标（做什么） + 规则（怎么玩） + 界面（长什么样） + 细节（数值、按钮）</p>
        <p><span style="color:$muted; font-size:13px">课堂练习：让学生先把想法写在纸上，再交给 Trae 的 Builder 生成。</span></p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 500, 64, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: 12 / 15
